How it works:

Divides total episodes evenly across tasks (e.g., 4 tasks × 41 episodes each = 164 total)
Phase 1: trains only on task 1's buffer, evaluates on all 4 tasks
Phase 2: loads same weights, trains only on task 2's buffer, evaluates on all 4
...and so on. Weights carry forward, showing catastrophic forgetting on earlier tasks.

